When SMTP mask lists are enabled, MailSite uses these masks to define a }{\i spam policy}{ for each SMTP connection.  These policies define which (if any) messages will be accepted during the SMTP session.  The spam policies used by MailSite are:
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s59 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \s59\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb60\sa60\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls143\pnrnot0
\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxtb \'b7}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls143\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\b AcceptAllMail}{, which causes all messages to be accepted regardless of sender and recipient.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s59 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \s59\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb60\sa60\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls143\pnrnot0
\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxtb \'b7}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls143\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\b AcceptLocalMailOnly}{, w
hich causes messages to be accepted only if they are addressed to mailboxes or mail lists within your MailSite domains.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s59 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \s59\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb60\sa60\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls143\pnrnot0
\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxtb \'b7}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls143\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\b RejectAllMail}{, which causes all messages to be rejected regardless of sender and recipient.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s59 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \s59\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb60\sa60\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls143\pnrnot0
\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxtb \'b7}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls143\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\b RejectAllMailFrom}{, which causes messages to be rejected only if they are from one or more specific users.
\par }\pard\plain \s3\ql \li360\ri0\sb60\sa60\widctlpar\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\i\f1\fs24\cf10\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
