 establishes an SMTP connection, MailSite does the following:
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-720\li1080\ri0\sb60\sa60\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx1080\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls27\pnrnot0
