The SMTP Delivery Service is the internal sorter for MailSite.  It deals with messages that have been received by the SMTP Receiver.
\par It moves messages from the }{\b\f2 incoming}{ directory, and stores them in a }{\b\f2 holding}{ directory. For each distinct domain in the list of message recipients, the service creates a subdirectory (within the }{\b\f2 domains}{
 directory), where it places information about the recipients in that directory.
\par For local deliveries, the service temporarily stores recipient information in a special }{\b\f2 $local$}{ subdirectory within the }{\b\f2 domains}{ directory. It then copies messages into each local recipient's }{\b\f2 inbox}{ directory.
