\par There are two types of banners: }{\b\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof Header}{\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof  and }{\b\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof Footer}{\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof 
. Headers are inserted at the top of the body of the email message, while footers are appended to the bottom of the message body (above all attachments).
\par You can set separate banners for plain text messages and HTML messages. This allows you to insert sophisticated HTML content (including banner advertisement graphics) in messages that contain HTML. If an HTML banner is not
