\par To use this option, specify the host name of the blacklist server in the }{\b\f2 Blacklist servers}{ field. When entering multiple values in field separate each entry with a comma.
\par When using blacklist servers it is recommended that you exempt your "friendly" hosts from blacklist lookup. This will prevent numerous unnecessary blacklist queries that would otherwise slow MailSite's SMTP performance.
