The time-of-day schedule consists of a list of times of the day at which delivery will be attempted.  A different list of times pertains on weekdays and weekends.
\par You can specify the maximum number of times that message delivery will be attempted before a message is treated as undeliverable.
\par }\pard\plain \s4\ql \li360\ri0\sb60\sa60\widctlpar\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\f2\fs20\ul\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
