Select the Domains Folder or one of the existing virtual domain folders.  Then choose the }{\b\f2 New}{ option from the Domain menu (or click the corresponding toolbar button, or right-click on the folder and select }{\b\f2 New}{
 from the popup menu).  A new domain folder will appear, and you should give it a unique name.  It is your responsibility to register the domain in the DNS.
\par }\pard\plain \s4\ql \li360\ri0\sb60\sa60\widctlpar\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\f2\fs20\ul\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
