Domains,Virtual}}}{You can receive mail addressed to multiple domains on a single server.  To do this, create a new entry for each under the Domains Folder.  With virtual domains, mailboxes and mail lists can be managed on a per-doma
in basis, and each domain may have its own postmaster.
\par }\pard \ql \li360\ri0\sb60\sa60\widctlpar\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 {For example, if you add a virtual domain }{\b\f2 xyz.com}{, then incoming mail sent to }{\b\f2 
