\par Note that the DNS MX record for }{\b\f2 xyz.com}{ must resolve to the IP address that is associated with domain }{\b\f2 xyz.com}{ listed here.  This is necessary so that other SMTP mail servers connect to the correct machine.  See the }{\uldb DNS Overview
}{\v\uldb DNSOverview}{ section and the section on }{\uldb Multiple Domains}{\v\uldb Domains}{ for more information.
\par }\pard \ql \li360\ri0\sb60\sa60\widctlpar\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 {
