f a mailbox name without attached domain is sent by the POP3, IMAP4 or SMTP client.  If the IP address does not have a domain associated with it, then the default domain name will be assumed. (See the section on the }{\uldb POP3 Server}{\v\uldb POP3Server
}{ for additional discussion of  how the domain name may be specified when a client logs in.)
